# Natu Enterprise - Furniture Store Management (ASP.NET Core website)

C# website built from the design report (Option 4). Requires the **.NET 8 SDK**.

## Run

    cd NatuFurniture
    dotnet run

Open the URL printed in the terminal (usually http://localhost:5000 or https://localhost:5001).
Data is saved to `App_Data/store.json` after every change; delete that file to reset to the sample data.

